<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Quick answer:</strong> The best toy storage ideas make cleanup easy for kids: keep a small set of toys on low shelves, give each toy type one bin with a picture label, and rotate the rest every week or two.</li>


<li>Keep a small set of toys out on low shelves and rotate the rest every week or two.</li>



<li>Give each toy type one bin with a picture label, at your child&#8217;s height.</li>



<li>Use closed storage in the living room and one big basket for stuffed animals.</li>
</ul>



