<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Start With Fewer Toys Out</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Before you buy bins, decide how many toys should be out at once. The easiest homes to keep tidy have a small set of toys on low shelves, the rest in storage, and a regular swap.</p>



